          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "When cast before (within 1 minute) a Mind Merge spell or a Ready Merge spell (an 11th+ level spell on this spell list in Spell Law), this spell allows the caster to focus on a specific person as the target (that he has Mind Stored previously). This spell allows certain spells to work even if the caster doesn't know the target's exact location."
        }
      },
