          "range": "100'",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "m",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster receives surface thoughts from target. If target makes his RR by more than 25 he realizes that someone is trying to read his thoughts. The caster can concentrate on a new target each round."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "06. Mind Merge I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
