          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Allows caster and target to interchange thoughts; if both are Mentalism spell users they can interchange power points. They must be able to see each other or the caster must know the exact location of the target or the caster must use Focus Merge to locate the target (in all cases, the target must be within range)."
        }
      },
      {
