          "range": "self",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "The caster prepares himself to be the target of a Mind Merge spell or Ready Merge spell (an 11th+ level spell on this spell list in Spell Law), thus, increases the range of the \"incoming\" spell. The increased range is equal to the original range times the number of power points used to cast the Prepare Merge spell (e.g., if a caster uses 18 PPs, the range is 18 times normal)."
        }
